712	  /**
713	   * return true if the object will draw a stroke
714	   * Does not consider text styles. This is just a shortcut used at rendering time
715	   * We want it to be an approximation and be fast.
716	   * wrote to avoid extra caching, it has to return true when stroke happens,
717	   * can guess when it will not happen at 100% chance, does not matter if it misses
718	   * some use case where the stroke is invisible.
719	   * @since 3.0.0
720	   * @returns Boolean
721	   */
